  - 'Angle 2 of 3: the BACK or SIDE with the INGREDIENT LIST. Keep the text flat
    and sharp, tilt the pack away from the light if it shines, then tap capture.'
  - 'Angle 3 of 3: the BARCODE. Line the bars up straight inside the frame, then
